      "id": "node-definition-algebra",
      "status": "bounded_supported",
      "observation": "Swiss lunar_osc_elem uses the geocentric Moon state and tangent/ecliptic-plane intersection; this is algebraically direction-equivalent to k x (r x v) when the z velocity is nonzero.",
